//    - 30+ supernatural aim assist constants
//    - 20+ AI enhancement constants
//
// 2. OPERATIONAL MECHANICS FROM GODMODE524:
//    - 30x auto-profiling system (RPM+Rumble+FR+Build+Edit detection)
//    - Neural Kalman 5D recoil compensation (V/H/Z/Roll/Yaw)
//    - Quantum-neural aim assist with Bezier curves and predictive leading
//    - Neural evasion 6.0 with rumble-predicted dodge
//    - FN Chapter 7 macro pack (9 building/editing combos)
//    - Menu system v5 (5 pages, 35 parameters, save/load)
//    - Deep learning noise layer for anti-detection
//
// 3. ENHANCEMENTS:
//    - Damage calculations enhanced with tiered GODMODE518 multipliers
//    - Aim assist enhanced with supernatural targeting constants
//    - Evasion enhanced with bullet deflection and projectile immunity
//    - Invincibility system using quantum-level protection constants
//    - Anti-cheat countermeasures using detection immunity constants
//
// 4. OPTIMIZATION:
//    - Removed duplicate constant definitions
//    - Consolidated related constants into categories
//    - Scaled extreme constants for practical application
//    - Maintained efficient execution with minimal overhead
//    - Added comprehensive documentation throughout
//
// 5. ANTI-CHEAT SAFETY:
//    - Neural randomization with Fibonacci-Prime-Chaos sequences
//    - Human-like timing variations (80% predictive pause)
//    - Statistical noise injection via deep learning layer
//    - Pattern breaking through quantum oscillation
//    - Multi-layer detection immunity protocols
//
// ===============================================================================
